  "remarks": "White Agate Marine SPC is a shipping company which manages tankers transporting Russian crude oil, including for export purposes. The company is the registered owner of several vessels which are subject to Union restrictive measures and which are transporting crude oil or petroleum products, originating in Russia or exported from Russia, and practice irregular and high-risk shipping practices as set out in the International Maritime Organisation General Assembly resolution A.1192(33).",
